# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER COMMIT CITIZEN DATA
# Downloaded backups are real citizen documents (medical certificates,
# good-conduct certificates, payment receipts, board decisions).
# They live in D:\mocd-docfix-data, OUTSIDE this repo, by design.
# These patterns are a second line of defence in case that ever changes.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
backup/
data/
downloads/
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.doc
*.docx
*.xls
*.xlsx

# Reports, manifests, state and logs contain document ids, file paths and
# citizen file names. Keep them out of the repo too.
reports/
state/
logs/
*.jsonl
scan-*.csv
migration-report-*.csv
review-*.csv
quarantine-*.csv
audit-*.log

# Secrets — API keys and CRM credentials are never stored in the repo.
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.Example.json
*.env
secrets.json

